#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:51
#: 5bfcdee9b04a424f869387ba4b5efd0e
msgid "MAP2 is powered by Pixhawk's power rail (the middle pin +). Ensure that the rail is powered by BEC or other power source ranging from 3.5-5.5 Volts in order for MAP2 to function properly."
msgstr ""

